flowchart LR
    A[CLI args<br/>cmd/regdiff] --> B{Input type?}
    B -->|.REG file| C[go-regis3 ParseFile<br/>KeyEntry tree]
    B -->|Registry path| D[internal/registry<br/>ReadRegistryPath]
    B -->|/REGISTRY| E[internal/registry<br/>LoadLiveRegistry]

    C --> F[diff.NewRegDiff<br/>collect mismatches]
    D --> F
    E --> F

    F --> G{Output mode}
    G -->|/DIFF| H[CreateDiffKeyEntry]
    G -->|/MERGE| I[CreateMergeKeyEntry]
    G -->|/WRITE only| I

    H --> J[go-regis3 RegWriter<br/>.REG output]
    I --> J
    H --> K[internal/registry<br/>WriteToRegistry]
    I --> K
